---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { UPWORK_URL } from "../lib/site";
---
<Layout
  title="About Tope Gideon — Top Rated Webflow Developer"
  description="Top Rated Webflow developer &amp; designer with 4+ years in web design and development. Figma to Webflow, CMS, technical SEO and migrations."
  path="/about"
  dataPage="about"
  stickyCta
  jsonLd={[{ "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", itemListElement: [
    { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: "https://topegideon.vercel.app/" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "About", item: "https://topegideon.vercel.app/about" },
  ] }]}
>
<section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="pT">
  <div class="page-hero__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow rv">About me</span>
    <h1 class="display page-hero__title rv rv--d1" id="pT">About<br>me</h1>
    <div class="page-hero__row rv rv--d3"><p class="lead">Top Rated on Upwork with 100% Job Success. Fast, clear sites built to convert.</p><a class="btn" href="/projects">View my projects <svg class="arr" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M5.5 4H12v6.5"/></svg></a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sheet" aria-labelledby="storyT">
  <div class="story">
    <figure class="story__img rv"><img src="/assets/images/tope.webp" alt="Tope Gideon" width="682" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
    <div class="story__body">
      <span class="eyebrow rv">My story</span>
      <h2 class="display h2 rv rv--d1" id="storyT">Top Rated Webflow developer</h2>
      <p class="rv rv--d2">I'm <b>Tope Gideon</b>, a <b>Top Rated Webflow developer &amp; designer</b> based in Ibadan, Nigeria, with <b>4+ years in web design and development</b>. I specialize in Figma-to-Webflow builds, CMS, technical SEO and SEO-safe migrations for startups, SaaS companies, agencies and B2B brands. I care about the parts of a website people actually feel: speed, clarity, and whether the next step is obvious.</p>
      <p class="rv rv--d3">I combine a clean <b>Client-First</b> build structure with technical SEO and performance work, so sites are easy to manage, technically solid and built to convert. Beyond Webflow I set up Memberstack portals, multi-step forms and booking flows, custom JavaScript and API integrations, and Zapier, Make and Airtable automations with CRM setup. When a project needs app-like behavior, I reach for React.</p>
      <p class="rv rv--d4">I don't just build websites. I build Webflow systems that help brands <b>rank higher, load faster, convert better,</b> and stay easy to manage long after launch.</p>
      <ul class="chips rv rv--d4" aria-label="Tools and skills"><li class="chip">Figma to Webflow</li><li class="chip">Client-First</li><li class="chip">Webflow CMS</li><li class="chip">Technical SEO</li><li class="chip">WordPress migration</li><li class="chip">Core Web Vitals</li><li class="chip">Memberstack</li><li class="chip">Zapier</li><li class="chip">Make</li><li class="chip">Airtable</li><li class="chip">GoHighLevel</li><li class="chip">Custom code</li></ul>
      <div class="story__cta rv rv--d4"><a class="btn btn--dark" href="/contact#request">Work with me <svg class="arr" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M5.5 4H12v6.5"/></svg></a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sheet" aria-labelledby="howT">
  <span class="eyebrow rv">My process</span>
  <h2 class="display h2 steps-title rv rv--d1" id="howT">How I work</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="step rv rv--d0"><span class="row__n">01</span><h3 class="display h3">Discovery</h3><p>We align on goals, audience, pages and deadlines. You get a clear scope, price and timeline before anything is built.</p></li>
    <li class="step rv rv--d1"><span class="row__n">02</span><h3 class="display h3">Structure &amp; design</h3><p>Sitemap, content structure and (for migrations) a redirect map first, then layout and visuals from your brand or Figma files.</p></li>
    <li class="step rv rv--d2"><span class="row__n">03</span><h3 class="display h3">Build</h3><p>I build in Webflow with a clean Client-First class structure: responsive, fast, accessible, with the CMS set up around how you'll edit.</p></li>
    <li class="step rv rv--d3"><span class="row__n">04</span><h3 class="display h3">Launch &amp; support</h3><p>Cross-device testing, SEO and speed checks, launch, a handover walkthrough, and ongoing support if you want a long-term Webflow partner.</p></li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="sheet" aria-labelledby="expT">
  <div class="split">
    <div class="split__side">
      <span class="eyebrow rv">Experience</span>
      <h2 class="display h2 rv rv--d1" id="expT">Where I've worked</h2>
      <p class="lead rv rv--d2">Webflow builds for construction, fintech and B2B teams, plus freelance work for clients worldwide.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="svc">
        <div class="tl__item rv rv--d0"><span class="row__n">2025 – Present</span>
          <div><h3 class="display h3">Freelance Webflow Developer &amp; Designer</h3><p class="tl__where">Upwork · Top Rated</p><p>Figma-to-Webflow builds, migrations, CMS and Memberstack projects for startups, SaaS companies, agencies and B2B brands.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tl__item rv rv--d1"><span class="row__n">Mar 2024 – Mar 2025</span>
          <div><h3 class="display h3">Webflow Developer</h3><p class="tl__where">Planet Project · Construction</p><p>Sole Webflow developer: built a responsive, SEO-conscious corporate site end to end with custom CMS structures and UI/UX improvements.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tl__item rv rv--d2"><span class="row__n">Feb 2024 – Apr 2025</span>
          <div><h3 class="display h3">Webflow Developer</h3><p class="tl__where">Cudium Inc · Fintech</p><p>Built the entire landing site from the UI/UX designs, with custom CMS development, responsive design and performance optimization.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tl__item rv rv--d3"><span class="row__n">2018 – 2023</span>
          <div><h3 class="display h3">Bachelor's in Computer Science</h3><p class="tl__where">Obafemi Awolowo University</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="creds rv rv--d4"><div><p class="creds__t">Certifications</p><ul class="chips"><li class="chip">Webflow Certification · Sep 2024</li><li class="chip">Web Development (Webflow) · Feb 2024</li></ul></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
